  <front>
    <title>DNS Security (DNSSEC) DNSKEY Algorithm IANA Registry Updates</title>
    <seriesInfo name="RFC" value="6725" stream="IETF"/>
    <author fullname="S. Rose" initials="S." surname="Rose">
      <organization showOnFrontPage="true">NIST</organization>
      <address/>
    </author>
    <date year="2012" month="August"/>
    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">The DNS Security Extensions (DNSSEC) require the use of cryptographic
algorithm suites for generating digital signatures over DNS data.
The algorithms specified for use with DNSSEC are reflected in an
IANA-maintained registry.  This document presents a set of changes
for some entries of the registry.</t>
    </abstract>
